# Files excluded from the installable ZIP by the Joomla Packager action.
# Patterns are rsync excludes, matched against the working tree.
#
# docs/ holds local documentation drafts (article HTML, stylesheet, JED copy,
# runbooks). It is git-ignored, so it never reaches git or the content
# fingerprint - but the packager builds with `rsync -a ./`, which copies the
# working tree rather than a git archive. Without this line the folder would
# ship inside every release ZIP.
docs/
